---
title: AdviseCare - Activity Diagram - WF3 Steward Sets Up Consent
---

flowchart TD
    S((Start)) --> A1[Steward signs in]
    A1 --> A2[Create data attributes: name, description, data type]
    A2 --> A3[Create a consent purpose, it starts inactive]
    A3 --> A4[Attach the data attributes the purpose covers]
    A4 --> D1{At least one active attribute?}
    D1 -->|No| A4
    D1 -->|Yes| A5[Activate the purpose]
    A5 --> B1[Create an access policy linking a staff role to the purpose, status draft]
    B1 --> B2[Test the policy against a sample student]
    B2 --> D2{Result as expected?}
    D2 -->|No| B3[Edit the draft policy]
    B3 --> B2
    D2 -->|Yes| B4[Activate the policy]
    B4 --> C1[Admin links each support category to its governing purpose]
    C1 --> D3{Purpose or policy no longer used?}
    D3 -->|Yes| C2[Retire the purpose or revoke the policy, never deleted]
    D3 -->|No| X((End))
    C2 --> X
